Elder brother works in china

Mèimei zài měiguó lǚxíng.
妹妹 在 美国 旅行.
Younger sister travels in America

呢 ne

Subject + Verb + Object + 呢 ne

妈妈 写 字 呢 !
Māmā xiězì ne!
Mum is writing characters.

Bàba dǎ diànhuà ne!
爸爸 打 电话 呢 !
Dad is making a phone call.


