认识. 他 叫 谢 亮, 他 是 我 哥哥 的 同学.
Yes, I do. His name is Xie Liang. He was my elder brother’s classmate.

Tā zài shūdiàn gōngzuò, duì ba?
他 在 书店 工作, 对 吧 ?
He is working in a bookshop. Right ? 

A: Duì. Tā hé nǐ gēgē shì dàxué tóngxué ma?
对. 他 和 你 哥哥 是 大学 同学 吗 ?
Yes. Were he and your elder brother classmates in university.

B: Bùshì, tāmen shì xiǎoxué tóngxué.
不 是, 他 们 是 小学 同学.
No, they were classmates in primary school. 



